OL,3,GNEWSA'I'll get emotional for son's
OL,4,Ainternational debut'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of Luis Binks, who has been
OL,7,Fcalled up to the senior men's Scotland
OL,8,Ffootball team for the first time, says
OL,9,Fshe will be "extremely emotional"
OL,10,Fseeing her son make his international
OL,11,Fdebut.
OL,13,FKent-born Binks is currently captain of
OL,14,FDanish side Brondby and the defender is
OL,15,Feligible to play for Scotland through
OL,16,Fhis mother's father.
OL,18,FHis mother, Jo Binks, said: "I will be
OL,19,Fextremely proud and also to know that
OL,20,Fthe connection is my dad who isn't here
OL,21,Fmeans something as well."
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
